{title: Hungama Hai Kyon Barpa}
{artist: Ghulam Ali}
{key: Dm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Dm] [C],        Hungama Hai Kyon Barpa,
[C] [Dm],        Thodi Si Jo Pii Lii Hai
[Dm],        Daakaa Toh Nahin Daalaa
[Dm] [C],        Chori Toh Nahi Kii Hai
[Dm] [A#],        Naa Tajurbakaari Se
[A] [Dm],        Baais Kii Ye Baatein Hai
[Dm],        Is Rang Ko Kyaa Jaane
[Dm] [C],        Puchho Toh Kabhi Pii Hai
[Dm] [A#],        Us Mai Se Nahi Matlab,
[A] [Dm],        Dil Jis se Hai Begaanaa
[Dm],        Maqasudd Hai Us Mai Se
[Dm] [C],        Dil Hii Mein Jo Khinchati Hai
[Dm] [A#],        Vaa Dil Mein Ki Sadame Do
[A] [Dm],        Yaa Kee Mein Ke Sab Sah Lo
[Dm],        Unkaa Bhi Ajab Dil Hai
[Dm] [C],        Mera Bhi Ajab Jii Hai
[Dm] [A#],        Har Zarra Chamaktaa Hai
[C] [Dm],        Anwaar-e-Ilaahi Se
[Dm],        Har Saans Ye Kehati Hai
[Dm] [C],        Hum Hai To Khuda Bhi Hai
[Dm] [A#],        Suraj Mein Lage Dhabba
[C] [Dm],        Fitrat ke Karishme hain
[Dm],        But Hum ko Kahein Kaafir
[Dm] [C],        Allah Ki Marzi Hai
